What you want to do is a classic VMS tutorial!  B^)  Allyagottadois...

Turn your command into a foreign command, thusly:

$ foo :== $<drive>:[account.some.where]foo.exe

Then, run it like this:

$ foo 3500

Then it'll work.  Plus, you can do this into command procedures
that you can then run batch, if desired!  Good luck, and have fun
with it!






